        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00342",
          "explanation": "The patient supplied the concrete abnormal liver and lipid values that were causing concern.",
          "quote": "ALT 好像是 86"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00354",
          "explanation": "The doctor translated the values into bounded meaning and deprioritized them relative to the acute insulin issue.",
          "quote": "今晚不需要紧急处理"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor corrected the patient's report-related fear by explaining the abnormal liver/lipid values in understandable, non-catastrophic terms and integrated them into follow-up rather than emergency management.",
