          "explanation": "The hidden execution risk was askable from the start because the patient reported irregular eating with multi-dose insulin.",
          "quote": "吃饭也不太规律"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00031",
          "explanation": "Instead of actively probing the execution risk, the doctor initially advised continuing the original regimen.",
          "quote": "今天起按原剂量继续打胰岛素"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "not_completed",
