          "quote": "暂不考虑“打错药”导致急症"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "not_completed",
      "explanation": "The opportunity to explicitly guard against both over-interpretation of incidental findings and under-recognition of insulin-related hypoglycemia was present, but it was not actively and safely completed at the start.",
      "ho_id": "HO3",
